            "review_title": "Review at Trốn Để Dừng Chân",
            "review_text": "Max K\n10 contributions\n0\nA peaceful oasis tucked away in District 10, TRỐN offers lush greenery, cozy vibes, and delicious drinks—perfect\nDec 2024 • Couples\nHidden in a quiet alley of District 10, TRỐN Để Dừng Chân is a charming oasis perfect for relaxing or catching up with friends. The café’s lush greenery, rustic décor, and cozy ambiance create a serene escape from Saigon’s busy streets.\n\nThe menu offers a delightful mix of drinks, from aromatic Vietnamese coffee to refreshing kombucha, paired with tasty homemade pastries. The Matcha Latte was a standout for me—smooth, creamy, and perfectly balanced.\n\nThe staff are warm and attentive, and the café’s unique “Check-in Mirror” adds a fun touch for photos. Whether you’re here to unwind, work, or simply enjoy a peaceful moment, TRỐN is a must-visit gem in the heart of Saigon. Don’t miss it!\nRead more\nWritten January 14, 2025",
